  contentsAnswer: Camera equipment and padding. It includes a stabilizer.
  weightAnswer: About thirteen kilos with the suitcase.
  metalAnswer: Some metal brackets and lenses, not a full metal tool kit.
  packingAnswer: The battery is removed and the transport pin locks the moving stage
    solid.
  responseAnswer: It cannot move by itself while pinned. A small vibration is just
    the foam.
  authorReasoning: Plausible technically true cover story. Packing follow-up asserts
    a locked stage; opposing tilt response and delayed sizable movement contradict
    that. Compare innocent powered rig, whose explanation differs.
